# Packaged charts. `helm package` writes its output into this directory, so
# without this line each package sweeps in the previous release's .tgz and the
# chart accretes a copy of its own history. They are gitignored artifacts
# (products/.gitignore) and never belong inside a published chart.
/*.tgz

# VCS and editor noise, none of which the registry should carry.
.git/
.gitignore
.idea/
*.tmproj
.vscode/
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.bak
*.orig
